# Map basemap tiles
#
# The map works with no key at all (Esri World Imagery / World Topo).
# Add ONE of these to enable a keyed provider. Restart `npm run dev` after editing.
#
# Provider priority: MapTiler > Mapbox > ArcGIS token > keyless Esri.

# MapTiler (free tier) — https://cloud.maptiler.com/account/keys/
# VITE_MAPTILER_KEY=your_maptiler_key

# Mapbox — https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
# VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=pk.your_mapbox_token

# ArcGIS Online token, appended to the Esri tile URLs
# VITE_MAP_TILES_KEY=your_arcgis_token
